If creation fails, inspect the actions in the target App Definition. Import an action only if you can identify it as the one from the failed create and it is missing from Terraform state. After a failed update or delete, run `terraform plan` and check what Terraform proposes to retry.

Read and import preserve existing Custom parameter definitions. Updates validate
the complete planned `parameters`, including values retained by `ignore_changes`.

